This repository's parse.js is a fork of marked 18.1.3, restructured for
speed on marked's default options. marked is MIT licensed; its LICENSE
is reproduced in this repository as LICENSE.

  package     marked@18.1.3 on npm (published 2026-11-02)
  source      https://github.com/markedjs/marked, tag v18.1.3,
              commit ba50aa95636ac8f97f46446bbfeb04592ed22216
